HM LAND REGISTRY DATA: NON-COMMERCIAL TERMS
The counts in data/ (lsoa_counts.csv, lad_counts.csv, region_counts.csv, jurisdictions.csv, years.csv, prices.csv,
holders.csv, site_lsoa.json, site.json, lad.geojson, results.json, models.csv) and every figure, map, GIF and collage are
derived from: HM Land Registry, Overseas companies that own property in England and Wales, full file, data at November 2026.
Information produced by HM Land Registry © Crown copyright 2026.
That dataset was used under HM Land Registry's licence for personal, non-commercial use. These derived aggregates are
shared for non-commercial research and reuse only, with the attribution above. They are NOT released under CC BY or any
licence that would allow commercial use, and nothing here may be used to reconstruct, republish or sell the HM Land Registry
information. No title number, property address, postcode, proprietor address or row-level record from the dataset is
included in this repository. For any other use, obtain the data and a licence from HM Land Registry
(https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/).

Other sources: Valuation Office Agency Council Tax stock of properties 2025 (Open Government Licence v3.0); ONS boundaries
(Open Government Licence v3.0; contains OS data © Crown copyright and database right), LSOAs via drkane/geo-lookups;
postcodes.io (ONS Postcode Directory, OGL v3.0); Tax Justice Network Financial Secrecy Index 2018 secrecy scores (via
Global-Witness/secret-property-analysis-2019-public); Wikidata (CC0) for search places.
